   "board 11: the tile adds D6's VA ticks to the kit's PREVIEW_MARKS (gen_11 tile_marks()); the kit's tile, which boards 08, 10, 42-48 and 53 embed, omits them until the kit adds 'va'.",
   "board 11: x / y / w / h rounded to 0.1 px after preview_tile() (its column and label shifts skip node()'s rounding).",
